{
  "sn12.55:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 12.55 ",
  "sn12.55:0.2": "6. Dukkhavagga ",
  "sn12.55:0.3": "Mahārukkhasutta ",
  "sn12.55:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṁ viharati. ",
  "sn12.55:1.2": "“Upādāniyesu, bhikkhave, dhammesu assādānupassino viharato taṇhā pavaḍḍhati. ",
  "sn12.55:1.3": "Taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṁ; ",
  "sn12.55:1.4": "upādānapaccayā bhavo …pe… ",
  "sn12.55:1.5": "evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti. ",
  "sn12.55:2.1": "Seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, mahārukkho. ",
  "sn12.55:2.2": "Tassa yāni ceva mūlāni adhogamāni, yāni ca tiriyaṅgamāni, sabbāni tāni uddhaṁ ojaṁ abhiharanti. ",
  "sn12.55:2.3": "Evañhi so, bhikkhave, mahārukkho tadāhāro tadupādāno ciraṁ dīghamaddhānaṁ tiṭṭheyya. ",
  "sn12.55:2.4": "Evameva kho, bhikkhave, upādāniyesu dhammesu assādānupassino viharato taṇhā pavaḍḍhati. ",
  "sn12.55:2.5": "Taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṁ …pe… ",
  "sn12.55:2.6": "evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti. ",
  "sn12.55:3.1": "Upādāniyesu, bhikkhave, dhammesu ādīnavānupassino viharato taṇhā nirujjhati. ",
  "sn12.55:3.2": "Taṇhānirodhā upādānanirodho; ",
  "sn12.55:3.3": "upādānanirodhā bhavanirodho …pe… ",
  "sn12.55:3.4": "evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa nirodho hoti. ",
  "sn12.55:4.1": "Seyyathāpi, bhikkhave, mahārukkho. ",
  "sn12.55:4.2": "Atha puriso āgaccheyya kuddālapiṭakaṁ ādāya. ",
  "sn12.55:4.3": "So taṁ rukkhaṁ mūle chindeyya, mūlaṁ chinditvā palikha